    <div class="page-faqs">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="row">
                <!-- Section Title Start -->
                <div class="section-title">
                    <h2 class="text-anime-style-3">Your shipping <span> questions</span> answered</h2>
                    <p class="wow fadeInUp" data-wow-delay="0.25s">Find answers to common questions about freight, shipment planning, and pet transport. For help with a specific route or booking, contact our team.</p>
                </div>
                <!-- Section Title End -->
            </div>

            <div class="row">
                <div class="col-lg-8 col-md-12 offset-lg-2">
                    <!-- FAQs Accordion Start -->
                    <div class="faq-accordion" id="accordion">
                        <!-- FAQ Item Start -->
                        <div class="accordion-item wow fadeInUp" data-wow-delay="0.25s">
                            <h2 class="accordion-header box-border-linear-gradient" id="headingOne">
                                <button class="accordion-button" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapseOne" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="collapseOne">1. What is the difference between transportation and logistics?</button>
                            </h2>
                            <div id="collapseOne" class="accordion-collapse collapse show" aria-labelledby="headingOne" data-bs-parent="#accordion">
                                <div class="accordion-body">
                                    <p>Transportation is the physical movement of goods by road, sea, air, or rail. It focuses on how a shipment travels, which route it takes, and when it arrives.</p>
                                    <p>Logistics covers the wider process, including transport planning, storage, inventory, order handling, and customer support. <%= business.name %> brings transport and coordination together to help shipments move smoothly from origin to destination.</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <!-- FAQ Item End -->

                        <!-- FAQ Item Start -->
                        <div class="accordion-item wow fadeInUp" data-wow-delay="0.5s">
                            <h2 class="accordion-header box-border-linear-gradient" id="headingTwo">
                                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapseTwo" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="collapseTwo">2. How can I make my supply chain more efficient?</button>
                            </h2>
                            <div id="collapseTwo" class="accordion-collapse collapse" aria-labelledby="headingTwo" data-bs-parent="#accordion">
                                <div class="accordion-body">
                                    <p>Start by finding repeated handling, avoidable delays, and gaps in shipment information. Clear workflows, tracking tools, and inventory planning can help you reduce waste while keeping stock available.</p>
                                    <p>Coordinate schedules with suppliers and customers, combine loads where practical, and choose routes that fit your deadlines. Our team can help you review transport options around your business needs.</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <!-- FAQ Item End -->

                        <!-- FAQ Item Start -->
                        <div class="accordion-item wow fadeInUp" data-wow-delay="0.75s">
                            <h2 class="accordion-header box-border-linear-gradient" id="headingThree">
                                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapseThree" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="collapseThree">3. How do I choose the right transport method?</button>
                            </h2>
                            <div id="collapseThree" class="accordion-collapse collapse" aria-labelledby="headingThree" data-bs-parent="#accordion">
                                <div class="accordion-body">
                                    <p>Consider what you’re shipping, how far it needs to travel, and when it must arrive. Fragile, perishable, bulky, or urgent goods can have very different handling and transport needs.</p>
                                    <p>Compare the total cost, available routes, reliability, and environmental impact of each option. We can help you weigh these factors against your cargo requirements and delivery priorities.</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <!-- FAQ Item End -->

                        <!-- FAQ Item Start -->
                        <div class="accordion-item wow fadeInUp" data-wow-delay="1s">
                            <h2 class="accordion-header box-border-linear-gradient" id="headingFour">
                                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapseFour" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="collapseFour">4. How do you plan for my pet’s comfort during travel?</button>
                            </h2>
                            <div id="collapseFour" class="accordion-collapse collapse" aria-labelledby="headingFour" data-bs-parent="#accordion">
                                <div class="accordion-body">
                                    <p>We review your pet’s needs, the proposed route, crate arrangements, and carrier requirements when planning the journey. Our team coordinates with handlers and helps owners understand the preparation needed at each stage.</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <!-- FAQ Item End -->

                        <!-- FAQ Item Start -->
                        <div class="accordion-item wow fadeInUp" data-wow-delay="1.25s">
                            <h2 class="accordion-header box-border-linear-gradient" id="headingFive">
                                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapseFive" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="collapseFive">5. What should I prepare before my pet travels?</button>
                            </h2>
                            <div id="collapseFive" class="accordion-collapse collapse" aria-labelledby="headingFive" data-bs-parent="#accordion">
                                <div class="accordion-body">
                                    <p>Plan early and confirm the required documents with your veterinarian, carrier, and destination authorities. We can help you organize the travel paperwork and crate arrangements. Document requirements and validity periods depend on the journey.</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <!-- FAQ Item End -->

                        <!-- FAQ Item Start -->
                        <div class="accordion-item wow fadeInUp" data-wow-delay="1.5s">
                            <h2 class="accordion-header box-border-linear-gradient" id="headingSix">
                                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapseSix" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="collapseSix">6. What affects the cost and timing of pet transport?</button>
                            </h2>
                            <div id="collapseSix" class="accordion-collapse collapse" aria-labelledby="headingSix" data-bs-parent="#accordion">
                                <div class="accordion-body">
                                    <p>The route, travel method, animal details, crate needs, available capacity, and destination requirements all affect the quote and schedule. Share these details with our team for a plan based on your pet’s journey.</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <!-- FAQ Item End -->

                        <!-- FAQ Item Start -->
                        <div class="accordion-item wow fadeInUp" data-wow-delay="1.75s">
                            <h2 class="accordion-header box-border-linear-gradient" id="headingSeven">
                                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapseSeven" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="collapseSeven">7. How can I improve my returns process?</button>
                            </h2>
                            <div id="collapseSeven" class="accordion-collapse collapse" aria-labelledby="headingSeven" data-bs-parent="#accordion">
                                <div class="accordion-body">
                                    <p>Set out clear return conditions, deadlines, and shipping responsibilities. Use one process to record returned goods, check their condition, and decide whether they can be resold, repaired, or recycled. We can help coordinate collection and transport.</p>
                                    <p>Review return reasons to identify recurring problems, combine return shipments where practical, and connect returned stock with your inventory process. Better coordination can reduce waste and recover value.</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <!-- FAQ Item End -->
                    </div>
                    <!-- FAQs Accordion End -->
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
